{
  "esm": "1.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicGasParticleMassTransfer",
    "description": "MOSAIC's gas-particle mass-transfer coefficient for ONE condensing gas and ONE size bin: SUBROUTINE aerosolmtc and the three functions it calls -- mean_molecular_speed, gas_diffusivity (the Fuller fit) and fuchs_sutugin -- in chem/module_mosaic_therm.F of WRF v4.8.0, on the sectional (msection) path WRF-Chem uses. Gases and bins are independent here, so a consumer maps the component over both rather than the component owning either index.\n\nIt also exposes cond_rate = gas*kg, which is the exact dt -> 0 limit of ASTEM's analytical non-volatile solution: that routine advances the gas by gas*(1 - exp(-sum_bins(kg)*dt)) and shares it over bins as kg/sum(kg), so the instantaneous per-bin rate is gas*kg with nothing approximated. The SEMI-VOLATILE branch of ASTEM is a different calculation -- its flux is kg*(gas - surface value) with the surface value from the particle's own thermodynamics, and it sub-steps adaptively -- so this component is not the whole of gas-particle transfer; it is the coefficient both branches are built on.\n\nWhat cannot be pinned by the reference. dp_wet and num_a are inputs: they come from calc_dry_n_wet_aerosol_props and MOSAIC's own size framework, which is a separate piece of physics. The Gauss-Hermite modal path in the same routine (msize_framework = mmodal) is not transcribed, because WRF-Chem runs the sectional one.",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "created": "2026-09-23T00:00:00Z",
    "tags": [
      "mosaic",
      "aerosol",
      "condensation",
      "mass-transfer",
      "wrf-chem",
      "chem_opt-170"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Fuchs, N. A. and Sutugin, A. G. (1971). High-dispersed aerosols. Topics in Current Aerosol Research, Pergamon."
      },
      {
        "citation": "Fuller, E. N., Schettler, P. D. and Giddings, J. C. (1966). A new method for prediction of binary gas-phase diffusion coefficients. Ind. Eng. Chem. 58(5), 18-27."
      },
      {
        "citation": "Zaveri, R. A., Easter, R. C., Fast, J. D. and Peters, L. K. (2008). Model for Simulating Aerosol Interactions and Chemistry (MOSAIC). J. Geophys. Res. 113, D13204."
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "MosaicGasParticleMassTransfer": {
      "subsystems": {
        "par": {
          "ref": "./mosaic_mass_transfer_parameters.esm"
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "t_k": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 305.6,
          "description": "Cell temperature MOSAIC works in, `t_k`."
        },
        "p_atm": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "atm",
          "default": 0.96,
          "description": "Cell pressure in atmospheres, `p_atm`."
        },
        "dp_wet": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm",
          "default": 6e-06,
          "description": "Wet diameter of this size bin, `dp_wet_a(ibin)` from calc_dry_n_wet_aerosol_props."
        },
        "num_conc": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1/cm^3",
          "default": 35.0,
          "description": "Number concentration of this bin, `num_a(ibin)`."
        },
        "mw_gas": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/mol",
          "default": 98.0,
          "description": "Molecular weight of the condensing gas (98 H2SO4, 96 MSA, 63 HNO3, 36.5 HCl, 17 NH3)."
        },
        "v_molar": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm^3/mol",
          "default": 42.88,
          "description": "Fuller diffusion molar volume of that gas (42.88 H2SO4, 58 MSA, 24.11 HNO3, 21.48 HCl, 14.9 NH3)."
        },
        "accom": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.1,
          "description": "Accommodation coefficient; MOSAIC uses 0.1 for every gas."
        },
        "gas_conc": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Gas-phase concentration of that species in MOSAIC's internal units, used only for the condensation rate below."
        },
        "speed": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "cm/s",
          "description": "Mean molecular speed of the gas, 1.455e4*sqrt(T/mw) (function mean_molecular_speed)."
        },
        "dg": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "cm^2/s",
          "description": "Gas diffusivity, the Fuller fit of function gas_diffusivity."
        },
        "freepath": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "cm",
          "description": "Gas mean free path, 3*dg/speed."
        },
        "knudsen": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Knudsen number of this bin for this gas, 2*freepath/dp_wet."
        },
        "fuchs_sutugin": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Transition-regime correction, 0.75*a*(1+Kn) / (Kn^2 + Kn + 0.283*Kn*a + 0.75*a)."
        },
        "cdum": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/cm^2",
          "description": "The geometric factor 2*pi*dp_wet*num_a that aerosolmtc forms once per bin (surface area per unit volume, up to the factor of 2)."
        },
        "kg": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "First-order mass-transfer coefficient of this gas to this bin, kg = cdum*dg*fkn -- what ASTEM condenses with."
        },
        "cond_rate": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/(m^3*s)",
          "description": "Condensation rate of a NON-VOLATILE gas onto this bin at the state the stage starts from, gas*kg. This is the exact dt -> 0 limit of ASTEM_non_volatiles' analytical solution, whose increment over a step is gas*(1 - exp(-sum_bins(kg)*dt)) shared over bins as kg/sum(kg)."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "speed",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "par.speed_c0",
              {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "t_k",
                      "mw_gas"
                    ]
                  },
                  0.5
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dg",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "par.dg_c0",
                  {
                    "op": "^",
                    "args": [
                      "t_k",
                      "par.dg_texp"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "^",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              1.0,
                              "mw_gas"
                            ]
                          },
                          "par.dg_mw_add"
                        ]
                      },
                      0.5
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "p_atm",
                  {
                    "op": "^",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "^",
                            "args": [
                              "v_molar",
                              "par.dg_vm_exp"
                            ]
                          },
                          "par.dg_vm_add"
                        ]
                      },
                      2.0
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "freepath",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "par.freepath_c0",
                  "dg"
                ]
              },
              "speed"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "knudsen",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  2.0,
                  "freepath"
                ]
              },
              "dp_wet"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "fuchs_sutugin",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "par.fs_c0",
                  "accom",
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      1.0,
                      "knudsen"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "knudsen",
                      "knudsen"
                    ]
                  },
                  "knudsen",
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "par.fs_c1",
                      "knudsen",
                      "accom"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "par.fs_c0",
                      "accom"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "cdum",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "par.two_pi",
              "dp_wet",
              "num_conc"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "kg",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "cdum",
              "dg",
              "fuchs_sutugin"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "cond_rate",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "gas_conc",
              "kg"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "chem170_step1_lev1_bin1_h2so4",
          "description": "Reference: the em_scm_xy chem_opt = 170 column of data/eqwefic/chem170_scm (fork branch earthsciml-instrumented-chem170, B20 fixed, GNU gfortran 13.3 REAL*4), dumped by the MOSAIC mass-transfer hook right after aerosolmtc at model step 1, level 1, size bin 1 of 8, gas H2SO4. Regime: T = 306.17 K, p = 0.9657 atm, wet diameter 6.13e-06 cm, number 35.83 /cm3. cond_rate is checked against the dumped non-volatile condensation rate for this bin, which the model forms as gas*kg independently of this component's own product. Tolerance measured, not assumed: over the twenty-five cases kg agrees with WRF to 3.9e-8 median and 1.7e-7 worst in a zero-tolerance run, and cond_rate to 3.7e-8 / 1.5e-7, so the bound is 5e-7. The kernel is double precision inside WRF (kind=8), so the residual is the single-precision storage of the dumped inputs and of kg itself, not the arithmetic.",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "t_k": 306.1650695800781,
            "p_atm": 0.9656776189804077,
            "dp_wet": 6.129607299953932e-06,
            "num_conc": 35.82890319824219,
            "mw_gas": 98.0,
            "v_molar": 42.88,
            "accom": 0.1,
            "gas_conc": 1.9570372794441138
          },
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 1
          },
          "tolerance": {
            "rel": 5e-07
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "kg",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 2.6988814170181286e-06
            },
            {
              "variable": "cond_rate",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 5.281811809254577e-06
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "chem170_step1_lev1_bin1_hno3",
